ch email having a type (e.g., HOME, WORK) and the email address itself.\",\"example\":null,\"items\":{\"example\":null,\"properties\":{\"email\":{\"description\":\"The actual email address of the contact, represented as a string.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"description\":\"The type of email address, which can be either 'HOME' or 'WORK'.\",\"enum\":[\"HOME\",\"WORK\"],\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"email\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"name\":{\"example\":null,\"properties\":{\"firstName\":{\"description\":\"A string representing the first name of the contact.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"lastName\":{\"description\":\"A string representing the last name of the contact.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"middleName\":{\"description\":\"A string representing the middle name of the contact.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"prefix\":{\"description\":\"A string representing the prefix of the contact's name, such as 'Mr.', 'Ms.', or 'Dr.'.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"suffix\":{\"description\":\"A string representing the suffix of the contact's name, such as 'Jr.', 'Sr.', or 'III'.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"org\":{\"example\":null,\"properties\":{\"company\":{\"description\":\"The name of the company the contact is associated with. It is a string value.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"department\":{\"description\":\"The department within the company where the contact works. It is a string value.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"The job title of the contact within their company. It is a string value.\",\"example\":null,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"phones\":{\"description\":\"An array of phone numbers for the contact, with each phone number including a type (e.g., CELL, MAIN, HOME, WORK) and the phone number.\",\"example\":null,\"items\":{\"example\":null,\"properties\":{\"p